     PMC_CAP_CASCADE      No
     PMC_CAP_EDGE         No
     PMC_CAP_INTERRUPT    Yes
     PMC_CAP_INVERT       Yes
     PMC_CAP_READ         Yes
     PMC_CAP_PRECISE      No
     PMC_CAP_SYSTEM       Yes
     PMC_CAP_TAGGING      No
